    "duration_sec": 19.86,
    "text": "No, I did not stomp on that girl's head. She'll tell you herself. I did not touch that girl. That's why I came out and they locked me up. But I ain't stomp on that girl head. They said I did,'cause everybody say stuff, but the detectives found out that I was telling the truth, and that's why they let me go.",
