    "end_sec": 186.58,
    "start_time": "02:59.320",
    "end_time": "03:06.580",
    "duration_sec": 7.26,
    "text": "They'd probably say that the witnesses were scared because you, you command a lot of respect out here on the street, and that people would be afraid to testify.",
